    "name": "The Tower",
    "steam_appid": 3492030,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a simple\u00a0<strong>dungeon grinder RPG</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How It Works:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a set of characters, customize their <strong>name</strong> and <strong>class</strong>, then go to The Tower's Guild. (You may edit your character mid-game).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter into a set of dungeons that are randomly selected, ensuring no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On-map enemy encounters</strong>, loot\u00a0<strong>treasure chests</strong>, and find the <strong>warp to the next floor</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>10th floor, </strong>you'll be facing a boss that will be randomly selected as well. Every time you beat this specific boss, their level will increase by 1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to <strong>The Tower's Guild Representative</strong> to buy better equipment and prepare for another run.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play a simple\u00a0<strong>dungeon grinder RPG</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How It Works:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a set of characters, customize their <strong>name</strong> and <strong>class</strong>, then go to The Tower's Guild. (You may edit your character mid-game).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter into a set of dungeons that are randomly selected, ensuring no two runs are the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>On-map enemy encounters</strong>, loot\u00a0<strong>treasure chests</strong>, and find the <strong>warp to the next floor</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every <strong>10th floor, </strong>you'll be facing a boss that will be randomly selected as well. Every time you beat this specific boss, their level will increase by 1.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talk to <strong>The Tower's Guild Representative</strong> to buy better equipment and prepare for another run.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Play a simple dungeon grinder RPG! Choose your character, customize their class and name, and delve into randomly selected dungeons filled with enemies and treasure. Gather loot, and gear up at The Tower's Guild to tackle higher floors..",
